                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "PREreview operates as a non-profit as a fiscally sponsored project of ",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                    "data": { "uri": "https://codeforscience.org/" },
                    "content": [
                      { "nodeType": "text", "value": "Code for Science & Society (CS&S)", "marks": [], "data": {} }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": ". CS&S is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit registered in the United States. CS&S provides administrative and strategic resources to project leads to support them in developing innovative technologies that benefit humanity. CS&S supports PREreview by assisting in building relationships with funding agencies, in connecting us with the larger public interest tech community, as well as in hiring and management of staff.",
